<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0043/na_0014> <http://digistrucmed.org/applicabilityExceptionStatus> "NONE_STATED" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0043/tu_0003> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Monitoring of daily weights, intake, and output is recommended to assess clinical efficacy of diuretic therapy. Routine use of a Foley catheter is not recommended for monitoring volume status. However, placement of a catheter is recommended when close monitoring of urine output is needed. (Strength of Evidence = C)" .
